3
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,240
If you want to say that, I have to see where he is.

4
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,960
Let me go help you check the situation of the wheat and forget it.

5
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:07,440
He's probably resting now. Don't disturb him. My Tianxiaolu.

6
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:10,680
He's not sleeping in your house, right? You can't do it, don't bother him, no, no, no, no

7
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,760
What are you thinking about when you say that I have to go see him?

8
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:13,760
