10
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,000
Watch the show at my place tonight

11
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,200
So I told him that it would be okay

12
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:21,320
He can rest here with me and I will pay him the salary. Where did you think you went? No, no, evil capitalist.

13
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,520
He actually started to be a good person

14
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,480
People work here

15
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,400
Can you still sleep on the alley with your money?

16
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,280
This doesn't even look like the you I know. Go, go, go.

17
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,480
I have to go see you

18
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,520
He fell asleep when he fell asleep. Where did he sleep?

19
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,960
As long as we don't disturb him

20
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,740
Oh my God, where did you find it?

21
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:35,900
Such a handsome guy

22
