28
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,340
And people also know to keep an eye on him.

29
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:48,780
There aren't many people like that nowadays, are there?

30
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:50,900
You make me feel weird with your ability to think

31
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:52,900
I would turn him into your boyfriend. It's not like you.

32
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,140
Sorry, you have money

33
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:56,620
Don’t you feel bad when you see someone carrying a building over there? Why don’t you wrap him up?
